<title>SINGAPORE: Pan-United in new Indonesian ship yard JV.</title>
<headline>Pan-United in new Indonesian ship yard JV.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Pan-United Corp said on Monday it was launching a joint venture with PT Repindo Mitra Abadi (Ripendo) of Indonesia to build a new shipyard in Batam, Indonesia.</p>
<p>Pan-united said in a statement its subsidiary company, Pan-United Venture Pte Ltd, would own 80 percent of the new company, with Ripendo owning the balance.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed. Pan-United said the effect on earnings would not be significant.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
